# Competitive Radar web — environment configuration
#
# V1 frontend is a STATIC, READ-ONLY renderer. It reads the compiled artifact
# `public/radar-static/radar.json` at build time (server components, node:fs).
# There is NO API, NO proxy, NO model key and NO required runtime env var.
#
# No configuration is needed for `npm run dev`, `npm run build` or Vercel.
#
# Optional (only if you later add canonical/OG absolute URLs):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-deploy-domain.example.com
#
# To refresh the data, run `radar build` in the repository root; it regenerates
# public/radar-static/radar.json from the authoritative files. Never edit the
# compiled JSON by hand.
